msgctxt "528"
msgid ""
"Seems like we could've done a lot better. Let's put in more\r\n"
"effort next time, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I'll make sure to do that... Thanks for being patient\r\n"
"with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid ""
"Good work out there tonight. I think you're getting the hang\r\n"
"of it."
msgstr "Bel lavoro là fuori stasera. Penso che tu ci stia prendendo la mano."

msgctxt "576"
msgid "Thanks. I'll keep doing my best to improve."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid ""
"Great job out there tonight. I could tell you were giving it\r\n"
"your all."
msgstr "Brava stasera! Si vedeva che ci hai messo tutta te stessa."

msgctxt "612"
msgid "Yeah! I was! Haha. I'll be sure to keep it up, then!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid ""
"Let's work on your presentation. Makeup, hair, posture...\r\n"
"All of these things send certain signals to a man."
msgstr ""
"Lavoriamo sulla tua presentazione. Trucco, capelli, postura... Tutte queste "
"cose mandano certi segnali a un uomo."

msgctxt "660"
msgid "Ooh, then I can't wait to hear all those juicy secrets!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "696"
msgid "All right, I think that just about covers it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "708"
msgid "Cool! I feel like I learned a lot just now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "744"
msgid "Hmm... I honestly think you have a ways to go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "756"
msgid "Really...? I thought I was beautiful just the way I am..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "792"
msgid ""
"Okay, so today we're going to study a little trivia. No\r\n"
"matter what the conversation, it's always important to be\r\n"
"smart about what you say. \"Knowledge is power,\" right?"
msgstr ""
"Allora, oggi ci faremo un ripassino su qualche curiosità. Non importa quale "
"sia la conversazione, è sempre importante essere scaltri in quello che dici."
" \"La conoscenza è potere,\" giusto?"

msgctxt "804"
msgid "I think I know what you mean! Okay, ask away!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "840"
msgid "All right, that should be more than enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "852"
msgid "Good, 'cause I'm feeling a lot smarter already! Hehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "888"
msgid "Hmm... I'm not quite sure you got the picture."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "900"
msgid "...Picture? I thought we were doing trivia."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "936"
msgid ""
"Right now, I'd like to give you some conversation tips to\r\n"
"help you captivate the customers. Sound good?"
msgstr ""
"Adesso, vorrei darti qualche dritta sulla conversazione per aiutarti a "
"conquistare i clienti. Ti va bene?"

msgctxt "948"
msgid "Ooh, got any good one-liners? We use 'em too, you know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "984"
msgid "All right, I think you've pretty much got it down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "996"
msgid "Hehe, now I can't wait to get out there! Thanks, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1032"
msgid "Hmm... I think you could still use a little work."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1044"
msgid ""
"Yeah, yeah... I get it... I'll just change overnight or\r\n"
"something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1080"
msgid ""
"I think you should spend your downtime doing whatever you\r\n"
"like. You've definitely earned it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1092"
msgid "Hey, I'll take you up on that! Thanks!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1128"
msgid ""
"Did you make the most of your time? You seem pretty\r\n"
"energetic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1140"
msgid "Definitely, those breaks really help!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1176"
msgid "Hmm... Are you sure you're doing okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1188"
msgid "Yeah... It's just that... I dunno... I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1224"
msgid ""
"Today, we're going to work on your weak points. Now I know I\r\n"
"might come off a little blunt, but bear with it, okay?"
msgstr ""
"Oggi lavoreremo sui tuoi punti deboli. So che potrei sembrare un po' brusco,"
" ma porta pazienza, d'accordo?"

msgctxt "1236"
msgid "...Okay."
msgstr "...Ok."

msgctxt "1272"
msgid ""
"All right, now think about what I told you and give it your\r\n"
"full effort next time."
msgstr ""
"Va bene, adesso pensa a quello che ti ho detto e mettici tutto l'impegno la "
"prossima volta."

msgctxt "1284"
msgid "Sure. I can do that."
msgstr "Certo, nessun problema."

msgctxt "1320"
msgid "(I don't think any of that really got through to her...)"
msgstr ""
"Non credo che le sia entrato in testa un bel niente di tutto questo..."

msgctxt "1332"
msgid "...We done here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1368"
msgid ""
"I think you should take some time off for yourself and relax\r\n"
"to your heart's content. Do what's good for %s."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1380"
msgid "Sounds like a plan! Thank goodness!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1416"
msgid "So, how was your time off?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1428"
msgid "Actually, it was just what I needed! Thanks for asking!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1464"
msgid "So, did you enjoy yourself?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1476"
msgid "Well, things happened and... I just couldn't seem to relax."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1512"
msgid ""
"Today, we're going to find a way to keep you motivated and\r\n"
"help you stay positive. How does that sound?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1524"
msgid "Sounds great! Let's get right to it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1560"
msgid "Well? How's that for positive thinking?"
msgstr "Allora? Questo sì che è pensiero positivo, no?"

msgctxt "1572"
msgid "I think that's an amazing concept! I like it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1608"
msgid "Well? Do you feel more positive now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1620"
msgid "Um... Would it be bad if I said no...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1788"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry for missing work without leaving notice... I just\r\n"
"didn't feel up to it today..."
msgstr ""
"Mi dispiace per non essere venuta al lavoro senza avvisare... Non me la "
"sentivo proprio."

msgctxt "1800"
msgid ""
"All right, just be more careful next time. I'll do my part\r\n"
"to give you the best guidance I can from here on out."
msgstr ""
"Va bene, la prossima volta stai più attenta. Io farò la mia parte per darti "
"le migliori dritte che posso d'ora in avanti."

